(Abstract) Tj
T* (    ) Tj
T* (  ) Tj
T* () Tj
T* (  ) Tj
T* (    Automated Teller Machines \(ATMs\) serve as the primary physical bridge between commercial banking systems) Tj
T* (and retail depositors. Managing cash replenishment across a decentralized network of ATMs poses a significant) Tj
T* (financial optimization dilemma for banking institutions. Overstocking an ATM incurs steep opportunity costs due) Tj
T* (to idle cash, increased insurance premiums, and vulnerability to theft. Conversely, understocking leads to) Tj
T* (catastrophic cash-out events, resulting in customer churn, regulatory penalties, and brand degradation.) Tj
T* (  ) Tj
T* () Tj
T* (  ) Tj
T* (    This project presents an end-to-end Machine Learning solution designed to forecast daily ATM cash withdrawal) Tj
T* (demand. The predictive engine is formulated around an optimized XGBoost Regressor \(Extreme Gradient) Tj
T* (Boosting\) model, utilizing six engineered input features: ATM ID, Weekday, Month, Previous Day Cash Demand,) Tj
T* (Previous 7-Day Average Demand, and a Working Day / Holiday indicator. The modeling pipeline was developed) Tj
T* (on an extensive real-world transaction dataset comprising 570,425 records following rigorous data cleaning,) Tj
T* (date-time transformation, and rolling-window feature engineering.) Tj
T* (  ) Tj
T* () Tj
T* (  ) Tj
T* (    The dataset was partitioned into an 80:20 training and testing split \(456,340 training records and 114,085) Tj
T* (testing records\). On the unseen evaluation set, the trained XGBoost model achieved a Mean Absolute Error) Tj
T* (␀\(␀M␀A␀E␀\)␀ ␀o␀f␀  ¹␀9␀1␀,␀5␀1␀2␀.␀2␀1␀,␀ ␀a␀ ␀R␀o␀o␀t␀ ␀M␀e␀a␀n␀ ␀S␀q␀u␀a␀r␀e␀d␀ ␀E␀r␀r␀o␀r␀ ␀\(␀R␀M␀S␀E␀\)␀ ␀o␀f␀  ¹␀1␀5␀8␀,␀9␀0␀2␀.␀7␀8␀,␀ ␀a␀n␀d␀ ␀a␀ ␀c␀o␀e␀f␀f␀i␀c␀i␀e␀n␀t␀ ␀o␀f␀ ␀d␀e␀t␀e␀r␀m␀i␀n␀a␀t␀i␀o␀n) Tj
T* (\(R² score\) of 0.4703. These results demonstrate moderate and stable predictive capability on baseline daily) Tj
T* (operational cycles, while realistically reflecting the elevated residuals inherent to volatile, non-linear high-demand) Tj
T* (periods such as regional festivals and monthly salary disbursement spikes.) Tj
T* (  ) Tj
T* () Tj
T* (  ) Tj
T* (    The trained model is serialized using Joblib and integrated into a lightweight Flask web application with an) Tj
T* (intuitive HTML5, CSS3, and JavaScript user interface. The deployed system allows bank treasury managers and) Tj
T* (cash-in-transit \(CIT\) logistics teams to supply operational parameters and instantaneously receive cash) Tj
T* (requirement forecasts, recommended cassette loading figures, and confidence thresholds to minimize both idle) Tj
T* (liquidity and cash-out incidents.) Tj
T* (  ) Tj
T* () Tj
T* (  ) Tj
T* (    Keywords: ) Tj
T* (    Automated Teller Machines, Cash Demand Forecasting, XGBoost Regressor, Supervised Machine Learning,) Tj
T* (Feature Engineering, Rolling Averages, Flask Web Application, Financial Analytics.) Tj
ET
