(The primary goal of this project is to develop and deploy an automated, data-driven machine learning system) Tj
T* (capable of estimating the daily cash requirement for individual ATMs. The specific objectives are outlined below:) Tj
T* (  ) Tj
T* () Tj
T* (  ) Tj
T* (    ) Tj
T* (      ) Tj
T* (        1) Tj
T* (        Data Processing at Scale) Tj
T* (      ) Tj
T* (      Clean, validate, and preprocess a large-scale transaction dataset comprising over 570,000 records across) Tj
T* (diverse ATM sites.) Tj
T* (    ) Tj
T* () Tj
T* (    ) Tj
T* (      ) Tj
T* (        2) Tj
T* (        Feature Engineering) Tj
T* (      ) Tj
T* (      Formulate 6 key predictive indicators: ATM ID, Weekday, Month, Previous Day Demand, Previous 7-Day) Tj
T* (Average, and Working Day/Holiday status.) Tj
T* (    ) Tj
T* () Tj
T* (    ) Tj
T* (      ) Tj
T* (        3) Tj
T* (        Model Training with XGBoost) Tj
T* (      ) Tj
T* (      Train an XGBoost Regressor on 456,340 training records using gradient boosted decision trees to minimize) Tj
T* (mean squared errors.) Tj
T* (    ) Tj
T* () Tj
T* (    ) Tj
T* (      ) Tj
T* (        4) Tj
T* (        Rigorous Empirical Evaluation) Tj
T* (      ) Tj
T* (      Benchmark model generalization across 114,085 unseen test records utilizing MAE, RMSE, and R² metrics) Tj
T* (with honest error analysis.) Tj
T* (    ) Tj
T* () Tj
T* (    ) Tj
T* (      ) Tj
T* (        5) Tj
T* (        Deployment via Flask Web Application) Tj
T* (      ) Tj
T* (      Package the trained model into a production-ready Flask microservice with an intuitive web dashboard for) Tj
T* (real-time interactive inference by bank treasury personnel.) Tj
