(The proposed system introduces an intelligent, centralized machine learning framework that replaces guesswork) Tj
T* (with quantitative regression forecasting. The system integrates machine learning algorithms, historical transaction) Tj
T* (aggregation, and web delivery into a unified architecture.) Tj
T* (  ) Tj
T* () Tj
T* (  10.1 Key Enhancements in the Proposed System) Tj
T* (  ) Tj
T* (    Predictive Accuracy via Extreme Gradient Boosting: Employs XGBoost Regressor to model complex) Tj
T* (interactions among cyclic dates, weekend surges, and short-term rolling momentum.) Tj
T* (    Compact and Effective Feature Set: Requires only six standardized operational parameters, ensuring that the) Tj
T* (system can be executed seamlessly in production without demanding complex external feeds.) Tj
T* (    Automated Rolling Aggregations: Features like Previous Day Demand and Previous 7-Day Average directly) Tj
T* (capture local momentum and trends.) Tj
T* (    Web-Based Accessibility: Implemented via Python Flask, enabling treasury controllers and logistics dispatchers) Tj
T* (to generate instant estimates from any browser.) Tj
T* (    Safe Buffer and Cassette Guidance: In addition to point estimates, the system accounts for residual variance) Tj
T* (␀\(␀M␀A␀E␀  ¹␀9␀1␀,␀5␀1␀2␀\)␀ ␀t␀o␀ ␀r␀e␀c␀o␀m␀m␀e␀n␀d␀ ␀p␀r␀a␀c␀t␀i␀c␀a␀l␀ ␀c␀a␀s␀s␀e␀t␀t␀e␀ ␀r␀e␀l␀o␀a␀d␀ ␀q␀u␀a␀n␀t␀i␀t␀i␀e␀s␀.) Tj
