(Raw transactional logs generated by ATM core banking switches inevitably suffer from real-world telemetry) Tj
T* (defects, including telecommunication drops, kiosk maintenance downtime, negative balance reversals, and) Tj
T* (corrupted timestamp records. A thorough data cleaning pipeline was constructed using Pandas:) Tj
T* (  ) Tj
T* () Tj
T* (  14.1 Key Cleaning Procedures) Tj
T* (  ) Tj
T* (    ) Tj
T* (      Deduplication: Multiple switch log entries matching identical \(ATM_ID, Date, Timestamp\) tuples were) Tj
T* (aggregated to prevent duplicate counting of single transactions.) Tj
T* (    ) Tj
T* (    ) Tj
T* (      Handling Missing / Null Values: Days where specific ATMs had missing logs due to localized electrical) Tj
T* (outages were evaluated. Where continuous outages exceeded 14 days, the records were flagged; short gaps were) Tj
T* (imputed or excluded from rolling window seeds to prevent biased zero-skew.) Tj
T* (    ) Tj
T* (    ) Tj
T* (      Anomaly and Negative Discard: Diagnostic reversal entries or negative cash adjustments \(resulting from) Tj
T* (mechanical bill-reject re-crediting\) were filtered out, ensuring all cash demand figures reflect genuine customer) Tj
T* (␀d␀i␀s␀p␀e␀n␀s␀a␀t␀i␀o␀n␀s␀ ␀\(␀C␀a␀s␀h␀ ␀D␀e␀m␀a␀n␀d␀ "e␀ ␀0␀\)␀.) Tj
T* (    ) Tj
T* (    ) Tj
T* (      Date Harmonization: Dates were parsed into standardized ISO-8601 datetime64[ns] format, facilitating) Tj
