(To transform the machine learning algorithm into an interactive decision-support tool, a lightweight web) Tj
T* (application was developed using the Python Flask microframework.) Tj
T* (  ) Tj
T* () Tj
T* (  21.1 Architectural Implementation \(app.py\)) Tj
T* (  ) Tj
T* (    The Flask application acts as the orchestration layer between the user interface and the serialized Joblib model.) Tj
T* (The server architecture operates through the following sequence:) Tj
T* (  ) Tj
T* () Tj
T* (  ) Tj
T* (    # app.py - Flask Machine Learning Microservice) Tj
T* (    from flask import Flask, render_template, request, jsonify) Tj
T* (    import joblib) Tj
T* (    import numpy as np) Tj
T* (    import pandas as pd) Tj
T* (    ) Tj
T* (    app = Flask\(__name__\)) Tj
T* (    model = joblib.load\('atm_cash_demand_xgb.joblib'\)) Tj
T* (    ) Tj
T* (    @app.route\('/'\)) Tj
T* (    def home\(\):) Tj
T* (        return render_template\('index.html'\)) Tj
T* (    ) Tj
T* (    @app.route\('/predict', methods=['POST']\)) Tj
T* (    def predict\(\):) Tj
T* (        data = request.form) Tj
T* (        atm_id = int\(data.get\('atm_id'\)\)) Tj
T* (        weekday = int\(data.get\('weekday'\)\)) Tj
T* (        month = int\(data.get\('month'\)\)) Tj
T* (        prev_day_demand = float\(data.get\('prev_day_demand'\)\)) Tj
T* (        prev_7day_avg = float\(data.get\('prev_7day_avg'\)\)) Tj
T* (        is_working_day = int\(data.get\('is_working_day'\)\)) Tj
T* (    ) Tj
T* (        input_df = pd.DataFrame\([{) Tj
T* (            'atm_id': atm_id,) Tj
T* (            'weekday': weekday,) Tj
T* (            'month': month,) Tj
T* (            'prev_day_demand': prev_day_demand,) Tj
T* (            'prev_7day_avg': prev_7day_avg,) Tj
T* (            'is_working_day': is_working_day) Tj
T* (        }]\)) Tj
T* (    ) Tj
T* (        prediction = model.predict\(input_df\)[0]) Tj
T* (        predicted_demand = max\(0.0, round\(float\(prediction\), 2\)\)) Tj
T* (    ) Tj
T* (        return jsonify\({) Tj
T* (            'status': 'success',) Tj
T* (            'predicted_demand': predicted_demand,) Tj
T* (            'mae_bound_lower': max\(0.0, predicted_demand - 91512.21\),) Tj
T* (            'mae_bound_upper': predicted_demand + 91512.21) Tj
T* (        }\)) Tj
T* (  ) Tj
T* () Tj
T* (  ) Tj
T* (    The REST endpoint guarantees sub-25 millisecond round-trip response times, permitting batch evaluation) Tj
T* (across hundreds of ATMs in bank treasury management portals.) Tj
ET
