(The implementation of the XGBoost-based cash demand forecasting system offers substantial financial and) Tj
T* (operational benefits for commercial banking institutions:) Tj
T* (  ) Tj
T* () Tj
T* (  ) Tj
T* (    ) Tj
T* (      Reduction in Idle Capital Cost: By replacing maximum-capacity blind loading with tailored predictions, banks) Tj
T* (can liberate crores of rupees in unproductively stranded liquidity, returning funds to overnight interest-bearing) Tj
T* (interbank markets.) Tj
T* (    ) Tj
T* (    ) Tj
T* (      Drastic Reduction in Cash-Out Incidents: Proactive identification of rising demand trends \(via 7-day rolling) Tj
