T* (    ) Tj
T* (    ) Tj
T* (      Optimized Armored Transit Logistics: Armored vehicle dispatch routes can be grouped by urgency and) Tj
T* (predicted depletion times, eliminating expensive emergency off-schedule CIT runs.) Tj
T* (    ) Tj
T* (    ) Tj
T* (      Enhanced Customer Trust and Retention: Reliable ATM availability reinforces consumer confidence in retail) Tj
T* (banking services, reducing customer defection to competing banks.) Tj
T* (    ) Tj
T* (    ) Tj
