(The project entitled "ATM Cash Demand Prediction Using Machine Learning" successfully develops, trains,) Tj
T* (validates, and deploys a robust machine learning solution addressing one of the most critical operational) Tj
T* (challenges in retail bank cash management.) Tj
T* (  ) Tj
T* () Tj
T* (  ) Tj
T* (    By transforming 570,425 transaction records into six informative temporal, situational, and rolling features, an) Tj
T* (XGBoost Regressor was trained on 456,340 observations and rigorously evaluated across 114,085 hold-out) Tj
T* (␀i␀n␀s␀t␀a␀n␀c␀e␀s␀.␀ ␀T␀h␀e␀ ␀e␀v␀a␀l␀u␀a␀t␀i␀o␀n␀ ␀y␀i␀e␀l␀d␀e␀d␀ ␀a␀ ␀M␀e␀a␀n␀ ␀A␀b␀s␀o␀l␀u␀t␀e␀ ␀E␀r␀r␀o␀r␀ ␀o␀f␀  ¹␀9␀1␀,␀5␀1␀2␀.␀2␀1␀,␀ ␀a␀ ␀R␀o␀o␀t␀ ␀M␀e␀a␀n␀ ␀S␀q␀u␀a␀r␀e␀d␀ ␀E␀r␀r␀o␀r␀ ␀o␀f) Tj
T* ( ¹␀1␀5␀8␀,␀9␀0␀2␀.␀7␀8␀,␀ ␀a␀n␀d␀ ␀a␀ ␀c␀o␀e␀f␀f␀i␀c␀i␀e␀n␀t␀ ␀o␀f␀ ␀d␀e␀t␀e␀r␀m␀i␀n␀a␀t␀i␀o␀n␀ ␀\(␀R␀²␀ ␀s␀c␀o␀r␀e␀\)␀ ␀o␀f␀ ␀0␀.␀4␀7␀0␀3␀.) Tj
T* (  ) Tj
T* () Tj
T* (  ) Tj
T* (    The empirical results illustrate that while extreme festive demand spikes present non-trivial forecasting) Tj
T* (challenges that widen quadratic errors \(RMSE\), the system maintains stable and dependable predictions across) Tj
T* (normal business cycles. ) Tj
T* (  ) Tj
T* () Tj
T* (  ) Tj
T* (    Finally, the deployment of this model via a responsive Flask web application proves the practical viability of) Tj
T* (the research, bridging academic machine learning algorithms with day-to-day banking treasury operations. The) Tj
T* (project satisfies all requirements for the final-year Bachelor of Computer Applications \(BCA\) curriculum under) Tj
T* (the Department of Computer Applications, [Insert College / Institute Name, e.g., St. Xavier's College / Heritage) Tj
T* (Institute / University Department].) Tj
